and the normalized preprocessed images will be saved in the image_preprocessed folder.

2)

Run :

python datasets/morph.py 
python datasets/fgnet.py
python datasets/utkface.py
python datasets/clap2016.py

These scripts generate full and reduced facial landmarks from the preprocessed images.

What they do: for each image in images_preprocessed, they:
  • extract the 68 full facial landmarks;
  • extract a reduced subset of key landmarks (e.g., eyes, nose, mouth);
  • save two .pts files per image:
  • points/ → 68 landmarks
  • points_reduced/ → selected landmarks for analysis (e.g., aging).

